<title>USA: National Datacomputer gets $0.5 mln order.</title>
<headline>National Datacomputer gets $0.5 mln order.</headline>
<dateline>BILLERICA, Mass. 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Datacomputer Inc said on Tuesday that it received an order from a customer in Japan valued at $511,600.</p>
<p>The company said the order was for its DC2.5 model hand-held computer, which is designed primarily for use by inventory auditors. It said shipments under the order should be completed during the third quarter, ending September 30.</p>
<p>National Datacomputer makes and sells handheld computers, data collection devices and peripherals.</p>
<p>(( --New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
